TASK TASK-007: Fix the logout cookie bug
Logged-out users keep an authenticated session cookie.
Reproduce it, find the cause, fix it and add a regression test.
The fix must not change the login flow.
Keep the cookie name; other services read it.

AGENTS YOU MAY ADDRESS (use these exact ids):
